     <period-end iso-date="2013-03-31"></period-end>
     <target value="600.00"></target>
     <actual value="800.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The two state of the art labs in mass and temperature allowed CSM to meet its targets. Moreover, additional high-precisionlaboratories are currently being installed and the new labs will further increase CSM&#x2019;s capacity to provide measurement andcalibration services with lower level of associated uncertainties in a wider range of units.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
